# CUTLASS CUP: a sensible player makes progress. The demo player presses
# real buttons each frame (it plays the way the best CPU does: it moves to
# where the ball will cross, swings early enough for a fast ball, rolls to
# reach it, lobs a rival who comes forward, charges broadsides and throws
# its trick at a lined-up rival). Through the menus and the tournament,
# continuing when it loses, it beats three opponents for the Beacon.
seed 3
game cutlass
wait 20
botuntil state == 2 200
botuntil defeated >= 3 60000
expect goals & 1
